Reason: with ENFORCE_VIRTUAL_FILES_SYNC_FOLDER ON, the sync options page showed "Download files on-demand" under
"Virtual files", "Synchronize everything" / "Choose what to sync" greyed out with no way to ask for them, and a
"Local sync folder" section whose Choose button is disabled. Drop the description, keep the two rows (still disabled),
add a Contact button that e-mails the operator's support address, and hide the folder section (the default folder
is used). Rendered per tenant by client-build/gen-oem.py from client-build/templates/patches/ (D-227, D-234).
Against nextcloud/desktop v34.0.7 (1e5b93f08b8ce07ffb3ad47d7def17df469b189c). No effect when classic sync is
available (enforcement off, or virtual files unsupported on the PC).
